---
export const title = 'Choices';
export const order = 250;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---
<p>
  A plain item's <code>selected</code> only shows the check mark; assistive technology does not hear it. To
  make a menu item an on/off or one-of-several choice, give it a <code>type</code>:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <code>type="checkbox"</code> renders a <code>menuitemcheckbox</code> with <code>aria-checked</code>.
    Activating it toggles <code>selected</code> and keeps the menu open, like native menus, so several can
    be switched in a row.
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>type="radio"</code> renders a <code>menuitemradio</code> with <code>aria-checked</code>. Activating
    it selects it and clears the other radio items of its group, the items between the same
    <code>wc-divider</code>s, then closes the menu. Add <code>keep-open</code> to keep it open.
  </li>
</ul>
<p>
  The new state is set before <code>menu-item-activate</code> fires, so a listener reads
  <code>event.detail.item.selected</code>. A link item that stands for the current page sets
  <code>current</code>, which renders <code>aria-current="page"</code>.
</p>
<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-button id='choices-anchor' variant='outlined'>View options</wc-button>

  <wc-menu id='choices-menu' anchor='choices-anchor' aria-label='View options'>
    <wc-menu-item type='checkbox' selected value='ruler'>Show ruler</wc-menu-item>
    <wc-menu-item type='checkbox' value='grid'>Show grid</wc-menu-item>
    <wc-divider></wc-divider>
    <wc-menu-item type='radio' value='compact'>Compact</wc-menu-item>
    <wc-menu-item type='radio' selected value='comfortable'>Comfortable</wc-menu-item>
    <wc-menu-item type='radio' value='spacious'>Spacious</wc-menu-item>
  </wc-menu>

  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      const menu = document.querySelector('#choices-menu');
      const anchor = document.querySelector('#choices-anchor');
      if (!menu || !anchor) return;

      anchor.addEventListener('click', () => {
        menu.open = !menu.open;
      });
    })();
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>
